ttps://api.github.com/users/bingcoder/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingcoder/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bingcoder/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-06T08:14:58Z","updated_at":"2026-03-06T08:14:58Z","body":"我切换了node的版本，然后执行 npm cache clean --force 解决了问题，你也可以试一下\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4010248984/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4211170171","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/996#issuecomment-4211170171","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/996","id":4211170171,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc77AVt7","user":{"login":"Reagan1947","id":35622305,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM1NjIyMzA1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35622305?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947","html_url":"https://github.com/Reagan1947","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Reagan1947/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T03:08:39Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T03:09:28Z","body":"## 1.0 版本与环境\n\n1. TRAE 版本: 3.3.43\n2. VSCode 版本: 1.107.1\n3. Electron: 39.2.7-release.1.28.8 (aha)\n4. Node.js: 22.21.1\n5. V8: 14.2.231.24-electron.0\n6. OS: Darwin arm64 25.3.0\n\n## 1.1 问题复现\n\n使用 Figma AI Bridge 配置 Access Token 出现\n\n```bash\nRROR: You must supply a command.\n\nExecute binaries from npm packages.\n\n  npx [options] <command>[@version] [command-arg]...\n\n  npx [options] [-p|--package <package>]... <command> [command-arg]...\n\n  npx [options] -c '<command-string>'\n\n  npx --shell-auto-fallback [shell]\n\n\nOptions:\n  --package, -p          Package to be installed.                       [string]\n  --cache                Location of the npm cache.                     [string]\n  --always-spawn         Always spawn a child process to execute the command.\n                                                                       [boolean]\n  --no-install           Skip installation if a package is missing.    [boolean]\n  --userconfig           Path to user npmrc.                            [string]\n  --call, -c             Execute string as if inside `npm run-script`.  [string]\n  --shell, -s            Shell to execute the command with, if any.\n                                                       [string] [default: false]\n  --shell-auto-fallback  Generate shell code to use npx as the \"command not\n                         found\" fallback.\n                                   [string] [choices: \"\", \"bash\", \"fish\", \"zsh\"]\n  --ignore-existing      Ignores existing binaries in $PATH, or in the local\n                         project. This forces npx to do a temporary install and\n                         use the latest version.                       [boolean]\n  --quiet, -q            Suppress output from npx itself. Subcommands will not\n                         be affected.                                  [boolean]\n  --npm                  npm binary to use for internal operations.\n                                                              [string] [default:\n              \"/usr/local/lib/node_modules/npx/node_modules/npm/bin/npm-cli.js\"]\n  --node-arg, -n         Extra node argument when calling a node binary.[string]\n  --version, -v          Show version number                           [boolean]\n  --help, -h             Show help                                     [boolean]\n\nFor the full documentation, see the manual page for npx(1).\n\n```\n## 1.2 问题处理\n\n尝试手动配置 MCP\n```json\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Figma AI Bridge\": {\n      \"command\": \"npx\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"-y\",\n        \"figma-developer-mcp\",\n        \"--stdio\"\n      ],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"FIGMA_API_KEY\": \"*******\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n````\n出现新的问题\n\n```bash\n(node:81004) [DEP0060] DeprecationWarning: The `util._extend` API is deprecated. Please use Object.assign() instead.\n(Use `node --trace-deprecation ...` to show where the warning was created)\nnpm ERR! cb.apply is not a function\n\nnpm ERR! A complete log of this run can be found in:\nnpm ERR!     /Users/jack/.npm/_logs/2026-04-09T02_15_32_335Z-debug.log\nInstall for [ 'figma-developer-mcp@latest' ] failed with code 1\n````\n\n降级 Node JS 到版本 v18.1.0\n\n手动添加 MCP 并指定 npx 位置\n\n```json\n\n{\n  \"mcpServers\": {\n    \"Figma AI Bridge\": {\n      \"command\": \"<YOUR NPX BIN PATH> 比如: /Users/jack/.nvm/versions/node/v18.1.0/bin/npx\",\n      \"args\": [\n        \"-y\",\n        \"figma-developer-mcp\",\n        \"--stdio\"\n      ],\n      \"env\": {\n        \"FIGMA_API_KEY\": \"figd_**********Owa-g\"\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}\n\n````\n**MCP Figma AI Bridge 成功运行**\n\n<img width=\"712\" height=\"243\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3d94cd33-af4e-46b3-9098-ca2456dcfeb1\" />\n\n\n## 1.3 Summary\n\nNode JS 版本兼容问题 (npx) 导致 MCP 服务启动失败\n\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/4211170171/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}